comment6.text=\r\n\ Calculates\ the\ popularity\ of\ a\ serie,\ if\ it\ has\ episodes\ with\ unkown\ values,\ it\ will\ take\ them\ as\ popularity\ of\ 0-\r\n\ @Throws\ NeoFlixException\ CONTENT_EMPTY\ if\ the\ series\ has\ no\ episodes\r\n
